%%begintext align
%% The O'Neills combined several of Goulding's tune collections into a single large volume.
%% The Vol.2 book seems to be missing. As usual, the Vol.1 book isn't numbered.
%% But its tunes are numbered 1-200, and Vol.3 is numbered 401-600.
%% (Vol.4 starts over with tune 1.)
%%endtext
%%sep 5 5 500

